OL,3,GNEWSAFather and son set three
OL,4,Amotorsport world records
OL,5,
OL,6,F"I'm really inspired by my dad," Will
OL,7,Fsaid, "I really just want to beat all
OL,8,Fhis records and get more than him," he
OL,9,Fadded.
